  "description": "The library resources area is situated behind the library office. Here you will find a collection of books on academic study skills, wellbeing topics and resources to assist with studying and computing. There is a selection of leads for connecting laptops to monitors, keyboards, mice, wrist supports and accessibility items, including coloured overlays, pen grips, magnifiers, book rests and laptop stands. We have a selection of stationery available for use in the library. In the wellbeing section you will also find mindful activities for breaks, such as origami, mindful colouring and puzzles with a mat available. Please speak to staff if you would like any additional resources, or if you need help with any of the equipment.",
